cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below (preferred-citation)."
title: "WattGPU: Predicting Inference Power and Latency on Unseen GPUs and LLMs"
abstract: >-
  WattGPU provides two predictive models for mean GPU power draw and
  Inter-Token Latency (ITL) of LLM inference workloads, using only publicly
  available LLM metadata and GPU specifications. This eliminates the need for
  hardware access or profiling while generalizing to NVIDIA server-grade GPUs
  and LLMs unseen during training.
